{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29139","headline":"寄殷尧藩先辈 · 许浑","name":"寄殷尧藩先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载功名翰墨林，爲从知己信浮沈。\n青山有雪谙松性，碧落无云称鹤心。\n带月独归萧寺远，翫花频醉庾楼深。\n思君一见如琼树，空把新诗尽日吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}